">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow my-auto mt-auto mb-auto is-vertical is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f9faaab3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 h1 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Proudly Serving the Communities In &amp; Around Virginia Beach Roads for Over 45 Years</h2>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 elevated-3-2 max-h-350 box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignleft size-full w100\"><img title=\"Vintage photo of an HVAC technician in a Russells service truck in Chesapeake, Virginia - Russell’s American Mechanical\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"982\" height=\"784\" src=\"/images/2024/10/Vintage-photo-of-a-technician-in-a-Russells-service-truck.jpg\" alt=\"Vintage photo of a technician in a Russells service truck\" class=\"wp-image-6085\"/></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"careers\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start wp-elements-7 has-background has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 h2 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8\">Careers at Our Company</h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">Russell’s and American Mechanical is setting up a new standard for home services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our technicians with resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. Come join us; we protect the people and culture that make our branch great while ensuring our customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://workforcenow.adp.com/mascsr/default/mdf/recruitment/recruitment.html?cid=59f8c526-3b15-45b8-8bbe-200cdbd4612du0026ccId=9200414389688_2u0026lang=en_US\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta my-3\">\n    <span >Open Positions</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border full-height-image mobile-3-2-ratio\"><img title=\"Best Place to Work Trophy for Russell&#039;s American Mechanical in Chesapeake, Virginia - Russell’s American Mechanical\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/10/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical.jpg\" alt=\"A “Best Places to Work” trophy for Russell’s American Mechanical\" class=\"wp-image-5774\" style=\"border-radius:0px\"/></figure>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-inverse-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-4 has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10\"><strong>Keeping Virginia Beach, VA &amp; Surrounding Areas Comfortable Since 1977</strong></h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, we have proudly served Virginia Beach, VA, and the surrounding areas since 1977, delivering exceptional HVAC and electrical services that ensure year-round comfort. Our experienced team is dedicated to providing top-notch installations, repairs, and maintenance for heating, cooling, and electrical systems, all tailored to meet the unique needs of our community. With decades of expertise, we focus on enhancing indoor air quality and energy efficiency, helping you enjoy a healthier and more cost-effective environment. Trust Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical to keep your home or business comfortable, reliable, and efficient, backed by our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img title=\"NearU logo - Russell’s American Mechanical\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/10/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\"/></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n&#8220;\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6473 -->"
